{
  "name": "09 · SEO Page Team (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Marketing)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🌙 FLOW – 5-Agent Local SEO Automation (@ai.nightshift)\nEvery night at 2 AM: research competitors → compare with your site → pick a missing search → write a page → editor checks it (sends it back if it fails) → publish to WordPress.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Fill in **Your business** (name, service, city, towns, facts, sitemap URL).\n2. **Find competitors**: add a *Header Auth* credential, name `X-Goog-Api-Key`, value = your Google Places API key.\n3. Connect your Anthropic key in the 4 **Claude** nodes.\n4. **Publish to WordPress**: connect WordPress (app password). It saves as **draft** first. Change status to *publish* once you trust it.\n5. Execute once, check the draft, then Activate.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "783dad22-9143-457b-977e-785bb55c8e6b",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        -520
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "03aba756-c291-435a-9d52-30855f1a27c3",
